 as Paraviyangala, and commonly known as Lovers' Peak, is a mountain in Sri Lanka. It falls within the Kalupahana mountain range. It is located approximately 5\u00a0km (3.1\u00a0mi) north east of Belihuloya in the Sabaragamuwa Province of Sri Lanka.</p>"}